blocks.en:
a controlled, exact-budget latent sequence-compression intervention in
frozen decoder-only Transformers, including explicit feasibility and rounding
semantics;

blocks.zh:
控制、精确预算的潜在序列压缩干预
仅被冻结的解码器变形器,包括明确的可行性和四舍五入
语义学;

blocks.en:
a multi-endpoint analysis separating fixed-target fit, distributional
proximity, task-relevant linear accessibility, behavior, and bounded
generation;

blocks.zh:
多端分析,将固定目标适合、分布
相近、与任务相关的线性访问、行为和界限
生成;

blocks.en:
matched controls showing when proxy improvement fails to certify
behavioral recovery and when a boundary-selection advantage is not reliably
detected;

blocks.zh:
匹配的控件, 当代理端改进无法验证时显示
行为恢复和边界选择优势不可靠时
检测;
